    <string name="inflection_de_heit">1. Converts an adjective into a noun and usually denotes an abstract quality of the adjectival root. It is often equivalent to the English suffixes -ness, -th, -ty, -dom:\n	 schön (“beautiful”) + -heit → Schönheit (“beauty”)\n	 neu (“new”) + -heit → Neuheit (“novelty”)\n2. Converts concrete nouns into abstract nouns:\n	 Kind (“child”) + -heit → Kindheit (“childhood”)\n	 Christ (“Christian”) + -heit → Christenheit (“Christendom”)\n</string>
